{
  "slug": "armorclaude",
  "name": "Armorclaude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Intent-based security enforcement for Claude Code. ArmorClaude makes Claude declare what it intends to do before doing it, then checks every tool call against that plan. Adds policy rules, intent drift detection, cryptographic proofs, and audit logging to the ArmorIQ platform. Works in both Claude Code CLI and Claude Desktop. Install with one curl command, optionally connect to ArmorIQ for signed JWT tokens and dashboard visibility.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, **8 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (1): `armor` (Manage ArmorClaude policy — list, add, confirm, profile, mcp, settings)\n- **Hooks** (8): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `UserPromptExpansion`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `PostToolUseFailure`, `Stop`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `armorclaude-policy`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install armorclaude@claude-community` from `armoriq/armorClaude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 8,
    "command": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
